%% 增量时序图（v1.0.3 工作计时多开）：并发开始 → 独立暂停 → 勾选完成只停该项 → 重启恢复
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant V as WorkTimerView / TodoView
    participant S as useAppStore
    participant M as IpcRegistry
    participant E as WorkTimerEngine
    participant D as StoreService

    Note over U,D: 1) 并发开始两项
    U->>V: 点「开始」A，再点「开始」B
    V->>S: startWork('A') / startWork('B')
    S->>M: invoke(workTimer:start, {todoId})
    M->>E: start('A') / start('B')
    E->>D: normalize 后追加 entry + updateTodo(timingStatus=running)
    E->>D: saveWorkTimerRuntime({timers:[A,B]})
    E->>D: moveTodoToTimerBlockTop(id) 仅首次开始
    D-->>S: data:changed → refreshData
    D-->>V: timer:tick(250ms) entries[] 渲染卡片

    Note over U,D: 2) 暂停 A，B 不受影响；继续 A 不置顶
    U->>V: 点 A 的「暂停」
    V->>M: invoke(workTimer:pause, {todoId:'A'})
    M->>E: pause('A')
    E->>D: A 条目 accumulatedBeforePauseMs += Δ, startedAt=null, timingStatus=paused
    U->>V: 点 A 的「继续」
    V->>M: invoke(workTimer:resume, {todoId:'A'})
    E->>D: A 条目 startedAt=now, pauseStartedAt=null（顺序不变）

    Note over U,D: 3) 勾选完成 B：只结算 B
    U->>V: 勾选 B
    V->>M: invoke(todo:toggle, {id:'B'})
    M->>E: stop('B')
    E->>D: B.accumulatedMs += 会话, lastTimingAt, timingStatus=idle
    M->>D: updateTodo(completed=true) + moveTodoToEnd('B')
    E->>D: timers 过滤掉 B（A 仍在运行）

    Note over U,D: 4) 重启恢复：逐条按真实时间补齐
    M->>E: restore(store.workTimerRuntime)
    E->>E: 逐条校验 todoId/running 缺 startedAt/已完成 → 只丢该项
    E->>D: saveWorkTimerRuntime({timers: kept}) + 全量对齐 timingStatus
